        "x1": 0.3023492651048049,
        "y1": 0.5340901769772924
      },
      "text": "Introduction",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11764397963978886,
        "y0": 0.5490866080679075,
        "x1": 0.8825420429503995,
        "y1": 0.561665698735401
      },
      "text": "Longitudinal data commonly arise in the study of dynamical systems across various disciplines, from physics",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11764396717345793,
        "y0": 0.5640867298299617,
        "x1": 0.8823486527586295,
        "y1": 0.5766658204974551
      },
      "text": "to biology and economics (see e.g. Hirsch et al., 2013). By observing multiple trajectories in a given space, we",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11764705882352941,
        "y0": 0.5792390926919802,
        "x1": 0.882543626174428,
        "y1": 0.5918181833594736
      },
      "text": "aim to extract key information about the underlying dynamics, such as governing laws, stability properties,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11764705882352941,
        "y0": 0.5942392144540344,
        "x1": 0.26450883952620763,
        "y1": 0.6068183051215278
      },
      "text": "or long-term trends.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2772539425519557,
        "y0": 0.5942392144540344,
        "x1": 0.882745680466197,
        "y1": 0.6068183051215278
      },
      "text": "A common approach to modeling such phenomena is to assume that the observed",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11764705882352941,
        "y0": 0.6093907296055495,
        "x1": 0.8823525422538807,
        "y1": 0.6219698202730429
      },
      "text": "trajectories follow an underlying differential system, which provides a structured framework for inference,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11764705882352941,
        "y0": 0.6245422447570647,
        "x1": 0.28489906959284367,
        "y1": 0.6371213354245581
      },
      "text": "prediction, and control.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14215686274509803,
        "y0": 0.6395423665191188,
        "x1": 0.8825446234809028,
        "y1": 0.6521214571866123
      },
      "text": "However, real-world data are often subject to noise, missing observations, and irregular sampling, making",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11764705882352941,
        "y0": 0.654693881670634,
        "x1": 0.8825442245583129,
        "y1": 0.6672729723381274
      },
      "text": "their analysis particularly challenging and raising interesting statistical questions. In particular, given noisy",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11764705882352941,
        "y0": 0.6698453968221492,
        "x1": 0.6668603435840482,
        "y1": 0.6824244874896426
      },
      "text": "observations of trajectories governed by an autonomous differential equation:",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": null,
